# Parameter definitions for thorn AsterAnalysis

BOOLEAN compute_MHD "Compute MHD quantities?" STEERABLE=always
{
} "yes"

BOOLEAN compute_MHD_spherical "Compute MHD quantities in spherical coordinates?" STEERABLE=always
{
} "no"

BOOLEAN compute_VI "Compute volume integrals?" STEERABLE=always
{
} "no"

BOOLEAN verbose "Do we want verbose output?" STEERABLE=always
{
} "no"

SHARES: AsterX
USES KEYWORD recon_type
